**Proposition 227.2 (Sharp sixteen-mask value).** For this $Y$,

$$
\min_{Z\in\mathcal K_6(Y)}J_{Q(Y)}(Z)=\frac{667}{198}.
$$

Consequently $y=Y/3$ is unit-$O$ but its normalized convex interior-mask
minimum is $667/594=1+73/594$.

