$D_a=N(3,5;0,3,5,0)$ and $D_b=N(1,3;0,1,3,0)$, with weights
$\nu_a=73/396$, $\nu_b=323/396$. Use one fixed hull law on
$v_3,v_5,v_6$, with weights

$$
\mu_3=\frac{239}{4752},\qquad\mu_5=\frac{43}{396},\qquad
\mu_6=\frac{3997}{4752}.
